摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"MOVED to dsh-dida — https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-dida. This repository is a pointer/backup; the old npm package @perrylink/dsh-ticktick is deprecated.","id":"gh:1355842222","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-ticktick","slug":"PerryLink/dsh-ticktick","topics":["ai-agent","ai-agents","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dida365","dsh","dsh-plugin","mcp","task","ticktick","todo","widget","workflow-automation"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"MOVED to dsh-dida — https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-dida. This repository is a pointer/backup; the "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"old npm package @perrylink/dsh-ticktick is deprecated."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"> **Moved:** this project is now **dsh-dida**. This repository stays as a pointer/backup; new work h"},{"id":"p2s2","text":"appens in the new home. Old npm package `@perrylink/dsh-ticktick` is deprecated; install `dsh-dida`."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# dsh-ticktick"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> Release stamp: `0.1.13` (2026-10-04)."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**English** | 中文 | Español | Português | हिन्दी"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> **Package name.** This project publishes to npm as **`@perrylink/dsh-ticktick`**. The bare npm nam"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"e `dsh-ticktick` belongs to a different, unrelated project — installing it does not install this plu"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"sh-ticktick` belongs to a different, unrelated project — installing it does not install this plugin."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"TickTick / Dida365 (滴答清单) task bridge for DeepSeek Harness: a Session-header task panel (list filter"},{"id":"p8s2","text":", quick add, complete, delete, due dates, drag reorder), eleven curated agent tools, a configuration"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" page on the Plugins page, and a typed Remote service — all over the official TickTick MCP endpoint."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` (bundle plugins activate on restart). The `ticktick` action appears in the Session"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" header; its configuration page opens from the **Configure** control on the TickTick row of the Plug"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"its configuration page opens from the **Configure** control on the TickTick row of the Plugins page."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## What is dsh-ticktick?"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"TickTick / Dida365 (滴答清单) task bridge for DeepSeek Harness: a Session-header task panel (list filter"},{"id":"p14s2","text":", quick add, complete, delete, due dates, drag reorder), eleven curated agent tools, a configuration"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" page on the Plugins page, and a typed Remote service — all over the official TickTick MCP endpoint."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"*Workflow overview: install → open panel → act. The examples below use the real command surface.*"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Surface | Status |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Harness | DeepSeek Harness **dsh-v0.2.1-alpha.1** (GitHub tag). npm dependency line: `@deepseek-ai"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"/dsh` **0.2.1-alpha.1** (peers `>=0.1.2-rc.1 <0.2.0 || >=0.1.5-alpha.1 <0.2.0 || >=0.1.6-0 <0.2.0 ||"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" >=0.1.7-0 <0.2.0 || >=0.2.0-0 <0.3.0 || >=0.2.1-0 <0.3.0`). Verified against the dsh-v0.2.1-alpha.1"},{"id":"p18s4","text":" checkout (full gate chain + profile install smoke). |\n| Node | `^22.19.0 \\|\\| >=24.0.0` |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **Session-header panel** — the `ticktick` action in the Session header opens a popup: filter by li"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"st (All + every list), toggle undone/completed views, full-text search, add tasks with an optional d"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ue date, complete, delete (with confirm), set/clear due dates with overdue/today/tomorrow chips, and"},{"id":"p20s4","text":" drag-reorder (undone, single-list views). A status dot shows the connection state; when no token is"},{"id":"p20s5","text":" configured the panel offers one-step in-panel token setup.\n- **Eleven agent tools** — `ticktick_sta"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"tus`, `ticktick_lists`, `ticktick_tasks`, `ticktick_add`, `ticktick_complete`, `ticktick_delete`, `t"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"icktick_due`, `ticktick_reorder`, `ticktick_completed`, `ticktick_search`, `ticktick_batch_add`; Cod"},{"id":"p20s8","text":"e Mode gets `await tools.ticktick_*(args)` for free.\n- **Configuration page** — Plugins page → the T"},{"id":"p20s9","text":"ickTick row → **Configure**: API token (secret), token file, MCP endpoint with CN/International pres"},{"id":"p20s10","text":"ets, protected task ids (all four applied live, no restart), a Test-connection button, and a Clear-c"},{"id":"p20s11","text":"redentials button.\n- **Live token re-read** — the Bearer token is re-read per request (card secret >"},{"id":"p20s12","text":" token file, default `$DSH_HOME/.ticktick-token`); a 401 resets the client so a rotated token activa"},{"id":"p20s13","text":"tes without restart.\n- **Measured workarounds** — the TickTick MCP server rejects `update_task` for "},{"id":"p20s14","text":"tasks inside regular projects (\"Expecting value: line 1 column 1\"); the bridge retries via a move-to"},{"id":"p20s15","text":"-inbox → update → move-back detour. Lists that fail server-side validation (historical `repeatFrom: "},{"id":"p20s16","text":"''` data) are skipped and reported as warnings, never silently dropped.\n- **Protected ids** — mutati"},{"id":"p20s17","text":"ng operations refuse tasks on the protected-id list before any wire call.\n- **Multi-device sync** — "},{"id":"p20s18","text":"every write lands on the TickTick cloud account, so the phone/desktop/web apps see it; every read fe"},{"id":"p20s19","text":"tches current state."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Examples"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"These are the plugin's real entry points; install once, then call one."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"#### Detailed example"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"**Command**"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**Input**"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**Output**"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"*Observed from `plugins/dsh-ticktick/src/tools.ts:107-109 (renderer); fixture/assertion at plugins/d"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"sh-ticktick/tests/service.spec.ts:40-46,103-108`*"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"#### Failure branch"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"**Input**"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"**Output**"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"*Observed from `plugins/dsh-ticktick/src/service.ts:344-349; plugins/dsh-ticktick/tests/service.spec"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"m `plugins/dsh-ticktick/src/service.ts:344-349; plugins/dsh-ticktick/tests/service.spec.ts:158-163`*"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"#### Brief examples"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"- `ticktick_tasks`\n- `ticktick_add`"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"1. Get an API 口令 (a `dp_`-prefixed token) from the Dida365/TickTick web app: Profile → Settings → Ac"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"count & Security → API 口令.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"- The international TickTick endpoint is **unverified**: `mcpUrl` defaults to the CN endpoint, and t"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"he international MCP URL has not been probed.\n- The completed view, search, and batch add ride the M"},{"id":"p44s3","text":"CP tools `list_completed_tasks_by_date`, `search`, and `batch_add_tasks`; their wire contracts come "},{"id":"p44s4","text":"from the published catalogue (`dida365-sdk` stubs) and **re-verification against the live endpoint i"},{"id":"p44s5","text":"s pending** — run `probes/probe-queries.mjs` with a real token before claiming them verified.\n- The "},{"id":"p44s6","text":"measured `update_task` crash and the list-validation failure are server-side behaviors; `probes/` re"},{"id":"p44s7","text":"-verifies them against the live endpoint before a release (run with `DIDA365_TOKEN` exported).\n- The"},{"id":"p44s8","text":" `/api` surface the panel uses is the standard harness Typert gateway; the token is stored locally ("},{"id":"p44s9","text":"settings document or token file) and sent only to TickTick's own servers. Do not expose a `dsh web` "},{"id":"p44s10","text":"instance to the public internet."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
